From 7763904d3c3a63165c97e7a89fea5e47fb253a36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:09:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(xtask): cargo xtask package is the one Windows zip
 layout

The portable tree and zip were staged twice: inline PowerShell in
release.yml's Windows job and xtask's release_pack (cargo xtask release).
`cargo xtask package [--version X.Y.Z] [--out dist] [--bin-dir <dir>]
[--dry-run]` now stages and zips, nothing else; the release cut's zip
phase and release.yml both call it. Without --version it reads post.exe
--version (the workflow's old single truth); under Actions it writes
version/stage/zip to $GITHUB_OUTPUT and CAMCRAFT_VERSION to $GITHUB_ENV,
and the installer step takes the reported stage. A real run off Windows
is refused by name; --dry-run lists the tree anywhere.

ci.yml / nightly.yml call cargo xtask gate batch|release directly (still
workflow_dispatch only). scripts/README.md's gate section is rewritten
around cargo xtask gate, CI wording corrected, package documented. The
process-file lists (AGENTS.md fork sync, review-prs 2d) add release.ps1
and collect-decisions.ps1/.sh; PROCESS_VERSION 8 -> 9.

Fixes #752

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
